    (pin "2" (uuid "ff7b062f-0150-4466-83b6-8a099a43c0e0"))
  )
  (text "ADS1299 carrier for ESP32-DevKitC-32. Unipolar: AVDD = 5 V from J1 pin 6, AVSS = GND. DVDD = 3.3 V from the DevKit 3V3 pin (J2 pin 1). Do not tie DevKit 5V to AVDD. J1 bottom-to-top on the PCB: 1 IN1P, 2 IN1N, 3 SRB1, 4 BIASOUT, 5 GND, 6 AVDD. Referential EEG: signal to IN1P, reference to SRB1, bias to BIASOUT. Differential EMG: IN1P, IN1N, BIASOUT. IN7 and IN8 are tied to AVDD for the ADS1299-6. Channels 2-6 are left open. CLKSEL pulled to DVDD. CLK, DAISY_IN and RESV1 tied to GND. GPIO1-4 pulled to GND. R1 1M in parallel with C13 10nF from BIASOUT to BIASINV. BIASIN and BIASREF are not connected on this carrier. SPI matches examples/ESP32_OpenBCI/ESP32_OpenBCI.ino Dev Module defaults: SCLK GPIO18, DIN/MOSI GPIO23, DOUT/MISO GPIO19, CS GPIO5, DRDY GPIO27, START GPIO25, RESET GPIO26, PWDN GPIO32. The PCB is the layout. Several analog nets are still open there; read the folder README before ordering boards." (at 20 210 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
